        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fulgencio Batista, Antonio Prío, Carlos Prío Socarrás, Osvaldo Farrés\n- Roles: President of Cuba\n- Works: “Quizás, Quizás, Quizás”\n- Events: Cuban coup d'état\n\nFacts:\n- Antonio Prío's brother was Carlos Prío Socarrás, who served as President of Cuba.\n- Fulgencio Batista held the same position as Carlos Prío Socarrás by serving as President of Cuba.\n- Osvaldo Farrés composed the song “Quizás, Quizás, Quizás.”\n- Carlos Prío Socarrás inspired Osvaldo Farrés.\n- Fulgencio Batista overthrew Carlos Prío Socarrás in a Cuban coup d'état.",
